      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRALAERO (2) was fresh up last time at this track where he finished fourth (22.75) in a Grade 4/5. Form here at the trip excellent including three wins. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Looks the one to beat on his best form. IT'S ALL BAD (4) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (30.29) at Nowra. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. BLACK TIARA (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.13) at Nowra behind Winsome Rambo in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to feature again. LIGHTNING LOTTE (8) is worth including after a top-three finish most recently.",
